# Read by ~/.claude/skills/release-gate and release-ship, sourced as shell.
#
# shortlife has no package manifest and no version string in the page. The
# version lives in one place a person edits: the top `## X.Y.Z` heading of
# CHANGELOG.md, which release prep adds. The tag is the release.
VERSION_CMD="grep -m1 -E '^## [0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+' CHANGELOG.md"
